### Notes
This RTC-AIGC demo application is a complete example that integrates real-time communication and AI-generated content, mainly used to demonstrate how to use Volcengine's RTC, ASR, LLM, and TTS services to build interactive AI applications. As a new developer, understanding the project's configuration requirements, startup process, core function implementation, and extension methods is most important. The project structure is clear, with front-end and back-end separation, but it requires correct configuration of various service AppIds, Tokens, and AK/SKs to run properly.
